=== exp1: CE traffic vs independent sm90 GEMM ===
world 4, GEMM on GPU 0, fp16 CUTLASS (TmaWarpSpecializedCooperative 128x256x64)
GPU 0: NVIDIA H800  sm_90  132 SMs  1980 MHz
GPU 1: NVIDIA H800  sm_90  132 SMs  1980 MHz
GPU 2: NVIDIA H800  sm_90  132 SMs  1980 MHz
GPU 3: NVIDIA H800  sm_90  132 SMs  1980 MHz
[note] lock clocks (nvidia-smi -lgc) before trusting slowdowns.

--- GEMM 2048x2048x2048 fp16: alone 29.8 us/iter (p95 30.0), 576.9 TFLOP/s, 2048 iters ---
pattern     msg    | ovl us/iter   ovl p95    S_c  TFLOP/s | alone GB/s   ovl GB/s | note
pull        64M    |        31.7      32.9  1.063    542.5 |     176.44     166.31 | 
push        64M    |        30.8      31.7  1.034    557.8 |     176.46     163.57 | 
allgather   64M    |        39.7      46.6  1.333    432.8 |     348.74     368.47 | 
bystander   64M    |        29.8      30.0  1.001    576.5 |     316.53     500.59 | 
engine-only 64M    |        29.7      30.1  0.997    578.7 |     171.25     154.26 | 
local       64M    |        66.7      68.8  2.240    257.6 |    1400.82     977.44 | 
baseline recheck: alone 29.8 -> 29.9 us/iter (drift +0.4%)

