--- GEMM 8192x8192x8192 fp16: alone 1696.9 us/iter (p95 1747.4), 648.0 TFLOP/s, 112 iters ---
pattern     msg    | ovl us/iter   ovl p95    S_c  TFLOP/s | alone GB/s   ovl GB/s | note
pull        64M    |      1720.6    1824.8  1.014    639.0 |     176.44     173.05 | 
push        64M    |      1718.9    1824.3  1.013    639.6 |     176.47     173.23 | 
