baseline recheck: alone 1696.9 -> 1700.3 us/iter (drift +0.2%)

S_c = GEMM iter time overlapped / alone. Compare patterns:
  bystander ~1.00 and pull/push > 1.00  => local HBM contention
  engine-only ~1.00                     => CE engine itself is free
  local >= pull/push                    => per-byte HBM cost ordering
